Note on card data text: The Persian interpretive texts in `data/cards.js`
(upright/reversed/love/career/finance/spiritual/symbolism descriptions) are
original authorship created for this project, released under the same MIT
license as the codebase. They are informed by the general, centuries-old
public tradition of Rider–Waite–Smith tarot structure, not copied from any
single copyrighted source. See SOURCES.md for details.
